## What to deliver

Author the muzzle-blast system operation by operation — the big blast core, the
forward gout of flame and heavy embers, and the thick rolling smoke plume, with the
forces and per-particle curves that make them project forward, arc, and roll as the
brief describes, and the timeline set to **loop** — running `particle-3d render` to
